OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over fatal crash with
OL,4,Acyclists
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with causing
OL,7,Fdeath by dangerous driving after a car
OL,8,Fhit three cyclists, killing two and
OL,9,Finjuring another.
OL,11,FKent Police said it had charged Aaron
OL,12,FTurner, 22, from Hermitage Road in
OL,13,FHigham, after the fatal crash near
OL,14,FGravesend on Sunday.
OL,16,FA man in his 60s and a woman in her 50s
OL,17,Fdied in the crash while the third
OL,18,Fcyclist was treated in hospital for
OL,19,Fminor injuries, a police spokesperson
OL,20,Fsaid.
