OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over fatal crash with
OL,4,Acyclists
OL,5,
OL,6,FA white Ford Focus was travelling
OL,7,Fsouth-west near the village of Sole
OL,8,FStreet at about 07:45 BST when it was
OL,9,Finvolved in the crash, according to
OL,10,Fpolice.
